B\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Disciples_of_Shar\" title=\"Disciples of Shar\">Disciples of Shar</a></b>, end chest (Heroic Hard)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\"> Charisma +5</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\"> Charisma +5</a></b>: This item makes the wearer have more flair, granting a +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Charisma.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Blurry\" title=\"Blurry\">Blurry</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Blurry\" title=\"Blurry\">Blurry</a>:</b> Equipping this item causes you to become slightly blurry. Attacks from enemies have a 20% chance to miss you due to concealment.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Guidance_of_Shar_(enchantment)\" title=\"Guidance of Shar (enchantment)\">Guidance of Shar</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Guidance_of_Shar_(enchantment)\" title=\"Guidance of Shar (enchantment)\">Guidance of Shar</a>:</b> On <a href=\"/page/Vorpal_Strike\" title=\"Vorpal Strike\">Vorpal Melee Hit</a>: Your target is blinded for 3 seconds.<br />10% Chance On Being Hit: You are blinded for 1 second. <a href=\"/page/Blindness_immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Blindness immunity\">Blindness immunity</a> does not prevent this effect.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-color:#DDA0DD;border-color:#225F22}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.green>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Green\"]{background-color:#90EE90;border-color:#6F116F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.yellow>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Yellow\"]{background-color:#EEE8AA;border-color:#111755}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.blue>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Blue\"]{background-color:#87CEFA;border-color:#783105}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.red>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Red\"]{background-color:#FA8072;border-color:#057F8D}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.colorless>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Colorless\"]{background-color:#F8F8FF;border-color:#070700}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.sun>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Sun\"]{background-color:#FFFFC0;border-color:#00003F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.moon>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Moon\"]{background-color:#C0FFFF;border-color:#3F0000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a{border:1px solid;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 3px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a{color:#003366}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a:visited{color:#040050}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.tooltip::after{content:\" augments.\"}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment green\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Green Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Blue_augments\" title=\"Category:Blue augments\">Blue</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Green_augments\" title=\"Category:Green augments\">Green</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Yellow_augments\" title=\"Category:Yellow augments\">Yellow</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Trinket Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Trinket Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Guidance_of_Shar_(Level_14).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Guidance_of_Shar_%28Level_14%29.png/420px-Guidance_of_Shar_%28Level_14%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"341\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Guidance_of_Shar_%28Level_14%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This thin black disc of metal is a holy symbol dedicated to Shar, Mistress of the Night.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p>After changes to augment type this item is no different to <a href=\"/